TALON: Tactical Allocation & Liquidity Order Engine
Copyright (c) 2026 TALON Quantitative Systems

This project is an original Python implementation of a quantitative trading worker,
portfolio risk engine, and walk-forward backtesting framework.

Architectural Inspiration & Audit Attribution:
The paper-by-default operational safety model and deterministic risk-gate philosophy
were informed by an architectural audit of https://github.com/imikerussell/beebots
(Copyright (c) 2026 Mike Russell, licensed under the MIT License). No source code
was copied from the audited repository; all modules in TALON were designed and
written from scratch in Python.
